rname>Berg</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Sanders</surname><given-names>AB</given-names></name><name><surname>Otto</surname><given-names>CW</given-names></name><name><surname>Ewy</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Assisted ventilation does not improve outcome in a porcine model of single-rescuer bystander cardiopulmonary resuscitation</article-title><source>Circulation</source><year>1997</year><volume>95</volume><fpage>1635</fpage><lpage>1641</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9118534</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Noc</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Weil</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Tang</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Turner</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Fukui</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mechanical ventilation may not be essential for initial cardiopulmonary resuscitation</article-title><source>Chest</source><year>1995</year><volume>108</volume><fpage>821</fpage><lpage>827</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7656640</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1378/chest.108.3.821</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bohm</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosenqvist</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Herlitz</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Hollenberg</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Svensson</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Survival is similar after standard treatment and chest compression only in out-of-hospital bystander cardiopulmonary resuscitation</article-title><source>Circulation</source><year>2007</year><volume>116</volume><fpage>2908</fpage><lpage>2912</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18071077</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.107.710194</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Dispatcher-Assisted Resuscitation Trial (DART)</collab></person-group><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/show/NCT00219687"/><comment>Accessed 19 Jan 2008</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Dispatcher assisted telephone CPR trial (DART)</collab></person-group><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.controlled-trials.com/ISRCTN82347313"/><comment>Accessed 19 Jan 2008</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ewy</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cardiac arrest &#x02013; guideline changes urgently needed</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2007</year><volume>369</volume><fpage>882</fpage><lpage>884</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17368131</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(07)60422-X</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ewy</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Continuous-chest-compression cardiopulmonary resuscitation for cardiac arrest</article-title><source>Circulation</source><year>2007</year><volume>116</volume><fpage>2894</fpage><lpage>2896</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18086938</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.107.751065</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Koster</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name><name><surname>Deakin</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name><name><surname>Bottiger</surname><given-names>BW</given-names></name><name><surname>Zideman</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Chest-compression-only or full cardiopulmonary resuscitation?</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2007</year><volume>369</volume><fpage>1924</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17560437</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(07)60904-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Svensson</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Eisenberg</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Castren</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Chest-compression-only or full cardiopulmonary resuscitation?</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2007</year><volume>369</volume><fpage>1924</fpage><lpage>1925</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17560436</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(07)60905-2</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>